{"seq":3,"slug":"error-handling","title":"错误处理 Result 与 Option","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/error-handling","wordCount":818,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"错误处理-result-与-option\">错误处理 Result 与 Option</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 不用异常，而用<strong>类型</strong>表达失败：可恢复错误是 <code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code> 的返回值，不可恢复错误是 <code>panic!</code>。理解本篇的关键，是把握由此产生的两个后果——错误是<strong>签名的一部分</strong>，调用者无法假装它不存在；以及错误的<strong>上下文与类型</strong>必须在设计时决定，这正是 <code>thiserror</code> 与 <code>anyhow</code> 的分工依据。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>错误即值</strong>：<code>?</code> 只是 <code>match</code> + <code>return</code> 的语法糖，没有任何隐式控制流跳转。</li>\n<li><strong>库与应用诉求不同</strong>：库应保留精确错误类型供调用者匹配（<code>thiserror</code>），应用只需附带上下文地传播（<code>anyhow</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong><code>unwrap</code> 是断言</strong>：它的语义是&quot;我认为这里不可能失败&quot;，用错位置就会把可恢复错误升级为崩溃。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理哲学\">错误处理哲学</h2><p>Rust 将错误分为两类：<strong>可恢复错误</strong>使用 <code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code>，<strong>不可恢复错误</strong>使用 <code>panic!</code>。没有异常机制，所有错误通过类型系统显式传递。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可恢复</td>\n<td><code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code></td>\n<td>文件未找到、网络超时、解析失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可恢复</td>\n<td><code>panic!</code></td>\n<td>数组越界、断言失败、程序 bug</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[操作可能失败?] --&gt;|是| B{失败是否预期?}&#10;    A --&gt;|否| Z[&quot;直接返回 T&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|是: 可恢复| C[&quot;Result&amp;lt;T, E&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否: 程序 bug| D[&quot;panic!&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;调用者决定如何处理&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;立即终止或 unwind&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[操作可能失败?] --&gt;|是| B{失败是否预期?}\n    A --&gt;|否| Z[\"直接返回 T\"]\n    B --&gt;|是: 可恢复| C[\"Result&amp;lt;T, E&amp;gt;\"]\n    B --&gt;|否: 程序 bug| D[\"panic!\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"调用者决定如何处理\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"立即终止或 unwind\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"操作符\">? 操作符</h2><p><code>?</code> 操作符是错误传播的语法糖——如果 <code>Result</code> 是 <code>Err</code>，立即返回该错误；如果是 <code>Ok</code>，提取内部值继续执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fs;&#10;use std::io;&#10;&#10;fn read_username_from_file() -&gt; Result&lt;String, io::Error&gt; {&#10;    let mut username = fs::read_to_string(&quot;username.txt&quot;)?;&#10;    username.truncate(username.trim_end().len());&#10;    Ok(username)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn read_username_from_file() -> Result&#x3C;String, io::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut username = fs::read_to_string(\"username.txt\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    username.truncate(username.trim_end().len());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(username)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>?</code> 操作符的等价展开：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn read_username_verbose() -&gt; Result&lt;String, io::Error&gt; {&#10;    let username = match fs::read_to_string(&quot;username.txt&quot;) {&#10;        Ok(content) =&gt; content,&#10;        Err(e) =&gt; return Err(e),&#10;    };&#10;    Ok(username.trim().to_string())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn read_username_verbose() -> Result&#x3C;String, io::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let username = match fs::read_to_string(\"username.txt\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(content) => content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(e) => return Err(e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(username.trim().to_string())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>?</code> 操作符还支持自动类型转换：只要错误类型实现了 <code>From&lt;SourceError&gt; for TargetError</code>，就能自动转换。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义错误类型\">自定义错误类型</h2><h3 id=\"手动实现\">手动实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fmt;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Debug)]&#10;enum AppError {&#10;    IoError(std::io::Error),&#10;    ParseError(String),&#10;    NotFound { resource: String },&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl fmt::Display for AppError {&#10;    fn fmt(&amp;self, f: &amp;mut fmt::Formatter&lt;&#39;_&gt;) -&gt; fmt::Result {&#10;        match self {&#10;            AppError::IoError(e) =&gt; write!(f, &quot;IO 错误: {}&quot;, e),&#10;            AppError::ParseError(msg) =&gt; write!(f, &quot;解析错误: {}&quot;, msg),&#10;            AppError::NotFound { resource } =&gt; write!(f, &quot;未找到: {}&quot;, resource),&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl std::error::Error for AppError {}&#10;&#10;impl From&lt;std::io::Error&gt; for AppError {&#10;    fn from(e: std::io::Error) -&gt; Self {&#10;        AppError::IoError(e)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fmt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Debug)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum AppError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IoError(std::io::Error),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ParseError(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NotFound { resource: String },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl fmt::Display for AppError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn fmt(&#x26;self, f: &#x26;mut fmt::Formatter&#x3C;'_>) -> fmt::Result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::IoError(e) => write!(f, \"IO 错误: {}\", e),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::ParseError(msg) => write!(f, \"解析错误: {}\", msg),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppError::NotFound { resource } => write!(f, \"未找到: {}\", resource),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl std::error::Error for AppError {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl From&#x3C;std::io::Error> for AppError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn from(e: std::io::Error) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AppError::IoError(e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-thiserror-库开发推荐\">使用 thiserror（库开发推荐）</h3><p><code>thiserror</code> 通过派生宏自动生成 <code>Display</code> 和 <code>Error</code> 实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use thiserror::Error;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Error, Debug)]&#10;enum DataError {&#10;    #[error(&quot;IO 操作失败: {0}&quot;)]&#10;    Io(#[from] std::io::Error),&#10;&#10;    #[error(&quot;JSON 解析失败: {0}&quot;)]&#10;    Json(#[from] serde_json::Error),&#10;&#10;    #[error(&quot;字段 `{field}` 验证失败: {reason}&quot;)]&#10;    Validation { field: String, reason: String },&#10;&#10;    #[error(&quot;记录 {0} 不存在&quot;)]&#10;    NotFound(u64),&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use thiserror::Error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Error, Debug)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum DataError {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"IO 操作失败: {0}\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Io(#[from] std::io::Error),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"JSON 解析失败: {0}\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Json(#[from] serde_json::Error),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"字段 `{field}` 验证失败: {reason}\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Validation { field: String, reason: String },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[error(\"记录 {0} 不存在\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NotFound(u64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"anyhow-应用层错误处理\">anyhow：应用层错误处理</h2><p><code>anyhow</code> 提供了 <code>anyhow::Result</code> 和 <code>anyhow::Error</code>，适合应用程序快速传播和附加上下文。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use anyhow::{Context, Result};&#10;use std::fs;&#10;&#10;fn load_config(path: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Config&gt; {&#10;    let content = fs::read_to_string(path)&#10;        .with_context(|| format!(&quot;读取配置文件 {} 失败&quot;, path))?;&#10;&#10;    let config: Config = serde_json::from_str(&amp;content)&#10;        .context(&quot;JSON 解析失败&quot;)?;&#10;&#10;    Ok(config)&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(serde::Deserialize)]&#10;struct Config {&#10;    port: u16,&#10;    host: String,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use anyhow::{Context, Result};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn load_config(path: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Config> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let content = fs::read_to_string(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with_context(|| format!(\"读取配置文件 {} 失败\", path))?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config: Config = serde_json::from_str(&#x26;content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .context(\"JSON 解析失败\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(serde::Deserialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Config {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port: u16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    host: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"thiserror-vs-anyhow-选择\">thiserror vs anyhow 选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>thiserror</th>\n<th>anyhow</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>库开发</td>\n<td>应用开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误类型</td>\n<td>自定义枚举</td>\n<td>统一 <code>anyhow::Error</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型信息</td>\n<td>保留，可 match</td>\n<td>擦除，需 downcast</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文附加</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n<td><code>.context()</code> / <code>.with_context()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误链</td>\n<td><code>#[from]</code> 自动实现</td>\n<td>自动捕获</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合器链式处理\">组合器链式处理</h2><p><code>Result</code> 和 <code>Option</code> 提供丰富的组合器方法，支持函数式链式处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn parse_and_double(input: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;i32, String&gt; {&#10;    input&#10;        .trim()&#10;        .parse::&lt;i32&gt;()&#10;        .map(|n| n * 2)&#10;        .map_err(|e| format!(&quot;解析失败: {}&quot;, e))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn parse_and_double(input: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;i32, String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .trim()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .parse::&#x3C;i32>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|n| n * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| format!(\"解析失败: {}\", e))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用组合器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th><code>Result</code> 行为</th>\n<th><code>Option</code> 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>map(f)</code></td>\n<td>变换 Ok 值</td>\n<td>变换 Some 值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>map_err(f)</code></td>\n<td>变换 Err 值</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>and_then(f)</code></td>\n<td>Ok 时链式调用</td>\n<td>Some 时链式调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>or_else(f)</code></td>\n<td>Err 时链式调用</td>\n<td>None 时链式调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unwrap_or(val)</code></td>\n<td>Err 时返回默认值</td>\n<td>None 时返回默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ok()</code></td>\n<td>转为 <code>Option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transpose()</code></td>\n<td><code>Option&lt;Result&gt;</code> ↔ <code>Result&lt;Option&gt;</code></td>\n<td>同左</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理最佳实践\">错误处理最佳实践</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn process_records(path: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Vec&lt;Record&gt;, AppError&gt; {&#10;    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)?;&#10;&#10;    let records: Vec&lt;Record&gt; = content&#10;        .lines()&#10;        .enumerate()&#10;        .map(|(i, line)| {&#10;            parse_record(line).map_err(|e| AppError::ParseError(&#10;                format!(&quot;第 {} 行: {}&quot;, i + 1, e)&#10;            ))&#10;        })&#10;        .collect::&lt;Result&lt;Vec&lt;_&gt;, _&gt;&gt;()?;&#10;&#10;    if records.is_empty() {&#10;        return Err(AppError::NotFound {&#10;            resource: path.to_string(),&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Ok(records)&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Record {&#10;    name: String,&#10;    value: f64,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn parse_record(line: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Record, String&gt; {&#10;    let parts: Vec&lt;&amp;str&gt; = line.split(&#39;,&#39;).collect();&#10;    if parts.len() != 2 {&#10;        return Err(format!(&quot;期望2个字段，实际 {}&quot;, parts.len()));&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(Record {&#10;        name: parts[0].to_string(),&#10;        value: parts[1].parse().map_err(|e| format!(&quot;{}&quot;, e))?,&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn process_records(path: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;Record>, AppError> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let content = std::fs::read_to_string(path)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let records: Vec&#x3C;Record> = content</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .lines()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .enumerate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|(i, line)| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            parse_record(line).map_err(|e| AppError::ParseError(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                format!(\"第 {} 行: {}\", i + 1, e)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .collect::&#x3C;Result&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;_>, _>>()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if records.is_empty() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(AppError::NotFound {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            resource: path.to_string(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(records)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Record {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: f64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn parse_record(line: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Record, String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let parts: Vec&#x3C;&#x26;str> = line.split(',').collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if parts.len() != 2 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(format!(\"期望2个字段，实际 {}\", parts.len()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(Record {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        name: parts[0].to_string(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        value: parts[1].parse().map_err(|e| format!(\"{}\", e))?,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库用 <code>thiserror</code></td>\n<td>保留类型信息，用户可精确匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用用 <code>anyhow</code></td>\n<td>快速开发，附加上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免滥用 <code>unwrap()</code></td>\n<td>仅在确信不会失败时使用，或搭配注释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先用 <code>?</code> 传播</td>\n<td>代码简洁，错误链完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提供有意义的错误消息</td>\n<td>包含文件路径、行号、上下文信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Rust 用 <code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code> 表达可恢复错误、<code>panic!</code> 表达不可恢复错误，错误是类型与签名的一部分。</li>\n<li><code>?</code> 是错误传播的语法糖，并支持通过 <code>From</code> 实现自动类型转换，让不同错误源汇聚到统一错误类型。</li>\n<li>库用 <code>thiserror</code> 保留可匹配的错误类型，应用用 <code>anyhow</code> 快速传播并附加上下文。</li>\n<li><code>Result</code>/<code>Option</code> 的组合器（<code>map</code>、<code>and_then</code>、<code>or_else</code> 等）支持函数式链式处理，避免深层嵌套。</li>\n<li>避免滥用 <code>unwrap()</code>：它把可恢复错误升级为崩溃，只在确信不会失败处或搭配注释时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"错误处理 Result 与 Option","id":"错误处理-result-与-option"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理哲学","id":"错误处理哲学"},{"level":2,"text":"? 操作符","id":"操作符"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义错误类型","id":"自定义错误类型"},{"level":3,"text":"手动实现","id":"手动实现"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 thiserror（库开发推荐）","id":"使用-thiserror-库开发推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"anyhow：应用层错误处理","id":"anyhow-应用层错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"thiserror vs anyhow 选择","id":"thiserror-vs-anyhow-选择"},{"level":2,"text":"组合器链式处理","id":"组合器链式处理"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理最佳实践","id":"错误处理最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"枚举与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/enums-and-pattern-matching"},"next":{"title":"类型状态模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/typestate-pattern"}}